okumusoro-soro pachake acharisimbisa.”","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Jehovha achanyora panonyorwa mazita amarudzi,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"kuti, “Uyu akaberekerwa muZioni.” Sera","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Pavanoimba, vachaimba vachiti,","poem":1},{"text":"“Matsime angu ose ari mamuri.”","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/sna_bib/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/sna_bib/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/sna_bib/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}